      comment: Visuals/tables support the analysis, but stronger chart design and
        interpretation would improve the presentation.
    Exploratory Data Analysis:
      score: 8.0
      comment: The EDA answers relevant questions and uses appropriate summaries,
        though deeper insight would strengthen it.
    Code Quality:
