      comment: Code is functional and organized, but some warnings/messages and repeated
        setup code could be cleaned.
    Data Preparation:
      score: 8.0
      comment: Data acquisition and cleaning are handled well, especially across population
        and migration datasets.
    Analysis and Findings:
      score: 8.0
      comment: Findings are relevant and clearly stated, though conclusions could
        be more strongly connected to evidence.
